Type:
--
Syntax:
{<symbol-phm-checkpoint>} = {<phm-checkpoint-value>};
Description:
For each enumeration in {<phm-checkpoint-list>} in [SWS_PHM_00424] there shall exist
a C++ enumerator declaration.
{<symbol-phm-
checkpoint>}
The checkpoint enumerator symbol name as given by
PhmCheckpoint. shortName.
Descriptors:
{<phm-checkpoint-
value>}
The checkpoint enumerator value as given by PhmCheckpoint.
checkpointId.
Example:
enum class MyPhmCheckpoints : std::uint32_t {
Initializing = 0U,
StartupTest = 1U,
InitializingFinished = 2U
};
